        "created_at": "2016-04-28T16:26:43.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>The campaign for my pirate-themed card game, <a href=\"http://www.scuttlegame.com\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"><em><strong>Scuttle!</strong></em></a>, is ending in the next 33 hours! One of the stretch goals we unlocked was a La Capitán promo for the game - <a href=\"https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/peterchayward/scuttle-the-pirate-card-game-for-all-ages/posts/1548705\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">you can read more about it here</a>.</p><p>It's a super fun, light game (with a solo mode co-designed by Christopher!) and the campaign has been doing&nbsp;<em>spectacularly</em> well. If you want to check it out (and get your hands on a unique La Capitán card!) then you can find it at <strong><a href=\"http://www.scuttlegame.com\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">scuttlegame.com</a></strong>!</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:47:24.640Z",
